1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,816
Atlantis sank beneath the sea... but did it?

2
00:00:04,066 --> 00:00:08,145
Beyond the Pillars of Hercules lay an empire of gold.

3
00:00:08,195 --> 00:00:13,295
A ring-shaped city of canals, bronze walls, and a temple to Poseidon.

4
00:00:13,345 --> 00:00:16,215
Its fleets conquered half the Mediterranean.

5
00:00:16,265 --> 00:00:21,330
Then, in a single day and night... the sea swallowed it whole.

6
00:00:21,480 --> 00:00:23,534
Or so the story goes.

7
00:00:23,684 --> 00:00:25,330
Let's start from the beginning.

8
00:00:25,380 --> 00:00:34,251
No ruin, no map, no inscription. Every word comes from one man: Plato, around 360 BC.

9
00:00:34,301 --> 00:00:40,658
He says an Egyptian priest told it to Solon... nine thousand years after it sank.

10
00:00:40,708 --> 00:00:43,809
No writer before Plato ever mentions it.

11
00:00:43,859 --> 00:00:49,721
In 1882, an American congressman turned it into a lost super-civilization.

12
00:00:49,821 --> 00:00:55,372
So did Atlantis sink... or was it never there at all?
